00:02:24.599 --> 00:02:26.933
About 100 feet
off the east corner!


00:02:26.966 --> 00:02:29.200
The whole world is watching!


00:02:29.234 --> 00:02:31.466
The whole world is watching!


00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:33.567
The whole world is watching!


00:02:33.599 --> 00:02:35.734
The whole world is watching!


00:02:35.766 --> 00:02:37.432
- You all right?
- Hmm. Yes.


00:02:37.466 --> 00:02:41.432
Okay. Let's go. Valet's got
the car out back. Hey.


00:02:45.533 --> 00:02:46.599
On the ground.


00:03:00.133 --> 00:03:02.633
They were barely older
than Charlotte.


00:03:02.667 --> 00:03:05.134
Baby, Charlotte's not going
to get mixed up in a riot.


00:03:06.866 --> 00:03:07.866
