laid off the adjectives.


00:12:20.767 --> 00:12:21.767
Baby.


00:12:26.134 --> 00:12:27.866
You have not lost your touch.


00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:30.667
What you did,


00:12:31.134 --> 00:12:33.067
you made me sound like
Clarence Darrow.


00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:37.600
- Don't go easy on me.
- I'm not.


00:12:41.167 --> 00:12:42.933
- Really?
- Really.


00:12:45.134 --> 00:12:48.667
It's beautiful.


00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:53.667
Oh, you okay?


00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:55.900
I truly don't want
to be the kind of guy


00:12:55.933 --> 00:12:57.466
that makes his wife cry.


00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:58.799
No, it's the hormones.


00:12:58.834 --> 00:12:59.933
Okay.


00:14:25.933 --> 00:14:27.167
What are you doing?


00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:29.966
Making dinner. Come join me.


00:14:30.167 --> 00:14:33.167
That's Lou Reed. No one cooks
to the Velvet Underground.


00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:41.500
- Wanna join me?
- Okay.


00:14:41.533 --> 00:14:43.500
All right.


00:15:03.167 --> 00:15:06.100
Are you all right?
Too old to keep up?


00:15:09.067 --> 00:15:10.600
Mom!


00:15:15.567 --> 00:15:17.900
- Hey.
- Hey.


00:15:17.933 --> 00:15:19.767
- Where is she?
- She's up.


00:15:19.799 --> 00:15:21.634
She's...
She's actually doing well.


00:15:21.667 --> 00:15:22.567
- Yeah?
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.


00:15:22.833 --> 00:15:25.799
- It's okay. She's okay.
- Okay. She's... Okay.


00:15:25.833 --> 00:15:28.734
- Uh, Charlotte... Did Charlotte...
- They're up in the cafeteria.


00:15:28.767 --> 00:15:30.134
Okay. Thanks for coming.


00:15:30.167 --> 00:15:31.966
- Yeah.
- What about the...


00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:33.600
Is the baby okay?


00:15:33.634 --> 00:15:35.700
Oh, I don't know. I'm sorry.


00:15:35.734 --> 00:15:37.067
She's... She's just in there.


00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:39.866
Okay. Okay.


00:15:40.334 --> 00:15:42.167
Hey.


00:15:43.834 --> 00:15:46.533
Mrs. Griffin's cardiomyopathy
of pregnancy


00:15:46.567 --> 00:15:49.100
in the first trimester,
it's very rare.


00:15:49.134 --> 00:15:50.966
But it is, without question,


00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:53.167
the cause
of the congestive heart failure.


00:15:54.033 --> 00:15:56.933
Okay, so, uh,
what's the treatment?


00:15:58.466 --> 00:15:59.500
To not be pregnant.


00:16:00.167 --> 00:16:00.966
And if she weren't,


00:16:01.234 --> 00:16:03.600
the condition would
reverse itself over time.


00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:05.734
There's...
There's no other treatment?


00:16:05.767 --> 00:16:07.600
There's got to be something
we could do, right?


00:16:10.167 --> 00:16:14.533
We, um...
We could ask the board


00:16:14.567 --> 00:16:17.667
for permission to perform
a therapeutic termination.


00:16:19.866 --> 00:16:21.033
What?


00:16:22.966 --> 00:16:24.634
That's the only option?


00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:27.567
I'm afraid so.


00:16:37.634 --> 00:16:39.933
Charlotte's gonna spend
the night at Lana's.


00:16:42.234 --> 00:16:43.533
Mm-hmm.


00:16:44.567 --> 00:16:45.767
Don't you worry.


00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:49.600
You let me do that.
We're gonna be...


00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:52.767
I'm gonna make this work.


00:17:00.900 --> 00:17:03.700
I still have so much left to do.


00:17:11.767 --> 00:17:14.400
The doctor said
there was a chance.


00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:17.432
We have to hold on to that.


00:17:24.034 --> 00:17:24.933
Why?


00:17:30.467 --> 00:17:31.834
We don't have a choice.


00:17:34.233 --> 00:17:36.634
Maybe your firm could help us.


00:17:38.201 --> 00:17:39.799
They have powerful bosses.


00:17:39.834 --> 00:17:42.733
I'm a criminal litigator.
How can I possibly...


00:17:43.532 --> 00:17:46.799
I don't cut corners.
I... I'm not a rule breaker.


00:17:46.834 --> 00:17:49.567
I... I follow rules. I don't lie.


00:17:49.599 --> 00:17:52.101
Will...


00:17:55.067 --> 00:17:57.101
How... How did it get to this?


00:17:59.532 --> 00:18:02.767
How... How the fuck
did it get to this?!


00:18:03.233 --> 00:18:04.733
We do everything right.


00:18:06.201 --> 00:18:08.101
I'm not leaving Charlotte.


00:18:08.134 --> 00:18:11.034
I want you here
with Charlotte, with me.


00:18:11.432 --> 00:18:12.532
Are you kidding me?


00:18:13.233 --> 00:18:15.034
But I don't know what...


00:18:18.067 --> 00:18:19.532
What do you want me to do?


00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:28.532
You know, I...
I wish we still went to church.


00:18:35.067 --> 00:18:36.166
Let's check this.


00:18:37.101 --> 00:18:39.532
- There we go. Dr. Falk.
- Oh. Hi.


00:18:39.567 --> 00:18:40.967
- How are you?
- Good.


00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:44.467
Hello. Um, I baked cookies.


00:18:47.067 --> 00:18:48.933
Uh, gentlemen,


00:18:48.967 --> 00:18:51.166
you're all familiar
with the details of this case.


00:18:51.201 --> 00:18:53.700
Mrs. Griffin has
petitioned the board


00:18:53.733 --> 00:18:55.599
to make an exception
to hospital policy


00:18:55.634 --> 00:18:56.634
so that she might proceed


00:18:56.666 --> 00:18:59.733
to an emergency termination
of her pregnancy.


00:19:00.166 --> 00:19:03.000
She understands that
this request is extraordinary?


00:19:03.034 --> 00:19:04.134
She does, yes.


00:19:04.166 --> 00:19:07.101
Is there a chance that
she can survive the pregnancy?


00:19:07.467 --> 00:19:09.201
A chance? Of course.


00:19:09.233 --> 00:19:10.799
Percentage of patients


00:19:11.467 --> 00:19:13.834
who survive a pregnancy
with this condition?


00:19:13.866 --> 00:19:16.799
It's difficult to say.
Maybe 50%.


00:19:16.834 --> 00:19:18.901
Is there a percentage
that would sway you?


00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:22.134
20%, 30%?


00:19:22.166 --> 00:19:25.034
This hospital has approved
termination of pregnancy


00:19:25.067 --> 00:19:28.034
once in the past ten years.


00:19:28.067 --> 00:19:30.201
Was Mrs. Griffin aware of that?


00:19:30.233 --> 00:19:32.000
No, she was not.


00:19:32.034 --> 00:19:35.599
I'm... I'm here.
I'm... I'm right here.


00:19:35.634 --> 00:19:37.067
I am comfortable with the data


00:19:37.101 --> 00:19:39.067
compiled in such cases.


00:19:39.101 --> 00:19:42.866
Full-term pregnancy resulting
in the birth of a healthy child,


00:19:43.233 --> 00:19:45.166
well within reason
for such a patient.


00:19:45.201 --> 00:19:46.799
- Therefore, I vote "no"...
- I...


00:19:46.834 --> 00:19:48.700
...to the termination.
Gentlemen?


00:19:49.300 --> 00:19:50.866
A healthy baby, that's it?


00:19:51.967 --> 00:19:53.866
No regard for her mother?


00:19:57.134 --> 00:19:59.467
- No.
- No.


00:20:00.134 --> 00:20:02.134
- No.
- No.


00:20:02.933 --> 00:20:04.134
No.


00:20:13.834 --> 00:20:14.901
Excuse me.


00:20:23.166 --> 00:20:25.967
So, um...


00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:28.134
So, there's always insanity.


